    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to EternaTIMA</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work for a company where not everything is as it seems, earn some money to pay the bills of your mom hospitalation and discover that your routine tasks hide dark secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Maintenance Tasks</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix generators, clean vents, activate machinery... Fill out your task board to complete your job.</strong><br><br><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">(<i>Without dying in the process</i>)</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/776e27cd0cb209ae2454b92c0d9c1999.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/776e27cd0cb209ae2454b92c0d9c1999.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/776e27cd0cb209ae2454b92c0d9c1999.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Survive</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the anomalies within the industrial facility, learn their behavior, and make it out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/d966a598269f8cc256cbb5d14640034f.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/d966a598269f8cc256cbb5d14640034f.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/d966a598269f8cc256cbb5d14640034f.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Uncover the Backstory</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unveil the truth behind the job offer and the personal connection between the company and your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/22b21f62019e8531deda0d19d875987f.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/22b21f62019e8531deda0d19d875987f.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/22b21f62019e8531deda0d19d875987f.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Can you survive the deadliest shift of your life?</i></strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Welcome to EternaTIMA</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work for a company where not everything is as it seems, earn some money to pay the bills of your mom hospitalation and discover that your routine tasks hide dark secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Maintenance Tasks</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix generators, clean vents, activate machinery... Fill out your task board to complete your job.</strong><br><br><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">(<i>Without dying in the process</i>)</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/776e27cd0cb209ae2454b92c0d9c1999.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/776e27cd0cb209ae2454b92c0d9c1999.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/776e27cd0cb209ae2454b92c0d9c1999.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Survive</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the anomalies within the industrial facility, learn their behavior, and make it out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/d966a598269f8cc256cbb5d14640034f.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/d966a598269f8cc256cbb5d14640034f.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/d966a598269f8cc256cbb5d14640034f.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Uncover the Backstory</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unveil the truth behind the job offer and the personal connection between the company and your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/22b21f62019e8531deda0d19d875987f.poster.avif?t=1751916660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/22b21f62019e8531deda0d19d875987f.webm?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/22b21f62019e8531deda0d19d875987f.mp4?t=1751916660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Can you survive the deadliest shift of your life?</i></strong></h2>",
